WEBVTT

00:28:58.288 --> 00:29:02.329
Sometimes healing is destruction.
Sometimes healing is turning away.

00:29:02.538 --> 00:29:06.204
Sometimes healing is a kind of
rage and anger, you know?

00:29:06.329 --> 00:29:09.621
And I think that for me, it was just
like I had to pass through.

00:29:11.329 --> 00:29:16.496
Everything so the image that always comes
to mind to me is one of total destruction,

00:29:17.704 --> 00:29:22.704
when I saw that I was going to lose
everything after my mom died and I did,

00:29:22.704 --> 00:29:26.329
my family also really fell
apart and was lost when

00:29:26.329 --> 00:29:29.579
I understood that that was what
was going to happen and that

00:29:29.579 --> 00:29:34.038
I couldn't make it not happen. That's
when I really turned to heroin.